{"step_index":405,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T22:49:53Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T01:49:53+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T01:49:53+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/setup.bat`\nTotal Lines: 76\nTotal Bytes: 2934\nShowing lines 1 to 76\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: @echo off\n2: chcp 65001 >nul\n3: title Pharmacy Matcher - Setup\n4: \n5: echo.\n6: echo ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n7: echo ║          Pharmacy Matcher - Setup Installer          ║\n8: echo ║          نظام مطابقة الأدوية - التثبيت               ║\n9: echo ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n10: echo.\n11: \n12: :: Check if Python is available\n13: python --version >nul 2>&1\n14: if %ERRORLEVEL% NEQ 0 (\n15:     echo [ERROR] Python is not installed or not in PATH!\n16:     echo Please install Python 3.10+ from https://python.org\n17:     pause\n18:     exit /b 1\n19: )\n20: \n21: echo [1/4] Creating virtual environment...\n22: if not exist \"venv\" (\n23:     python -m venv venv\n24:     echo       Done.\n25: ) else (\n26:     echo       Already exists.\n27: )\n28: \n29: echo.\n30: echo [2/4] Installing project requirements...\n31: call venv\\Scripts\\activate.bat\n32: pip install --quiet --upgrade pip\n33: pip install --quiet -r requirements.txt\n34: pip install --quiet pywebview\n35: echo       Done.\n36: \n37: echo.\n38: echo [3/4] Installing MSEMAX requirements (if present)...\n39: if exist \"MSEMAX\\requirements.txt\" (\n40:     pip install --quiet -r MSEMAX\\requirements.txt\n41:     echo       Done.\n42: ) else (\n43:     echo       MSEMAX folder not found, skipping.\n44: )\n45: \n46: echo.\n47: echo [4/4] Creating Desktop shortcut...\n48: :: Create a VBS script to make a shortcut\n49: set SCRIPT_PATH=%~dp0run.bat\n50: set SHORTCUT_PATH=%USERPROFILE%\\Desktop\\Pharmacy Matcher.lnk\n51: set ICON_PATH=%~dp0desktop_app\\static\\icon.ico\n52: \n53: :: Write VBS to create shortcut\n54: echo Set WshShell = CreateObject(\"WScript.Shell\") > \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n55: echo Set Shortcut = WshShell.CreateShortcut(\"%SHORTCUT_PATH%\") >> \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n56: echo Shortcut.TargetPath = \"%SCRIPT_PATH%\" >> \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n57: echo Shortcut.WorkingDirectory = \"%~dp0\" >> \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n58: echo Shortcut.WindowStyle = 7 >> \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n59: echo Shortcut.Description = \"Pharmacy Matcher - نظام مطابقة الأدوية\" >> \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n60: if exist \"%ICON_PATH%\" (\n61:     echo Shortcut.IconLocation = \"%ICON_PATH%\" >> \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n62: )\n63: echo Shortcut.Save >> \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n64: \n65: cscript //nologo \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n66: del \"%TEMP%\\create_shortcut.vbs\"\n67: echo       Shortcut created on Desktop.\n68: \n69: echo.\n70: echo ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n71: echo ║              Setup completed successfully!           ║\n72: echo ║         Double-click \"Pharmacy Matcher\" on Desktop   ║\n73: echo ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n74: echo.\n75: pause\n76: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
